  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Training Capacity of the School of Advocates</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The development objective of the Grant is to strengthen the capacity of the School for Advocates (SFA) to (a) design and deliver training; (b) provide legal aid services to the most vulnerable; and (c) develop sustainable financing arrangements to support its key activities. Four components are proposed under the project, namely: Component 1, Introduction of new means of training such as  webinars, group webcasts and group audio discussions and  &apos;train trainers&apos; activity Component 2, Design and implement a strategy for pro bono activities Component 3, Design and implement a self funding mechanism to support its activities on a sustainable basis. Component 4, Support to SFA in project implementation and Grant audit TF013656</narrative>
  </description>
